{"id": "P8-01", "question": "Does the later criticism of first/second turns retract the 2023 definition?", "classification": "elaboration_not_retraction", "confidence": "moderate_for_spoken_relationship", "finding": "A turn remains an opportunity for proactive value. The 2026 criticism targets first/second as instructions without a plan for opponent choices; it adds delayed rotations and counterplay rather than retracting the earlier vocabulary.", "open_test": "The edited examples cannot establish that any first move forced a specific enemy belief or every cooldown exchange.", "source_claims": [{"claim_id": "P4-005", "video_id": "c92ESPjlveI", "upload_date": "2023-11-28", "start": "00:00:58", "end": "00:01:30", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=c92ESPjlveI&t=58s"}, {"claim_id": "P4-007", "video_id": "c92ESPjlveI", "upload_date": "2023-11-28", "start": "00:06:35", "end": "00:07:25", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=c92ESPjlveI&t=395s"}, {"claim_id": "P4-014", "video_id": "K6Ayz-NHVe4", "upload_date": "2024-11-23", "start": "00:01:30", "end": "00:02:45", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=K6Ayz-NHVe4&t=90s"}, {"claim_id": "P4-033", "video_id": "KlcWDgdXrZk", "upload_date": "2026-03-08", "start": "00:00:00", "end": "00:01:38", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KlcWDgdXrZk&t=0s"}, {"claim_id": "P4-035", "video_id": "KlcWDgdXrZk", "upload_date": "2026-03-08", "start": "00:10:35", "end": "00:12:15", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KlcWDgdXrZk&t=635s"}, {"claim_id": "P4-206", "video_id": "KlcWDgdXrZk", "upload_date": "2026-03-08", "start": "00:09:15", "end": "00:11:05", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KlcWDgdXrZk&t=555s"}], "visual_sources": [{"window_id": "V6-01", "video_id": "c92ESPjlveI", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=c92ESPjlveI&t=380s", "review_status": "reviewed_sampled"}, {"window_id": "V6-02", "video_id": "c92ESPjlveI", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=c92ESPjlveI&t=540s", "review_status": "reviewed_targeted"}, {"window_id": "V6-03", "video_id": "KlcWDgdXrZk", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KlcWDgdXrZk&t=125s", "review_status": "reviewed_sampled"}, {"window_id": "V6-04", "video_id": "KlcWDgdXrZk", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KlcWDgdXrZk&t=545s", "review_status": "reviewed_sampled"}]}
{"id": "P8-02", "question": "Does backing up to go forward conflict with fighting the setup?", "classification": "conditional_distinction", "confidence": "moderate_for_spoken_relationship_limited_visual", "finding": "He rejects a retreat forced after the opponent has angles and reach, while recommending an early voluntary reset that retains distance, cooldowns, concealment, and a later fight location. The 2026 video explicitly contrasts its advice with the earlier example.", "open_test": "V6-05 ends before the losing sequence, and V6-07 does not verify the eventual win; exact distances and pursuit require a fuller replay.", "source_claims": [{"claim_id": "P4-021", "video_id": "LpxT2dykNK0", "upload_date": "2025-06-12", "start": "00:00:40", "end": "00:01:40", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LpxT2dykNK0&t=40s"}, {"claim_id": "P4-133", "video_id": "LpxT2dykNK0", "upload_date": "2025-06-12", "start": "00:03:39", "end": "00:07:18", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LpxT2dykNK0&t=219s"}, {"claim_id": "P4-030", "video_id": "Hl-nV1aF1yE", "upload_date": "2026-01-26", "start": "00:00:55", "end": "00:02:40", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Hl-nV1aF1yE&t=55s"}, {"claim_id": "P4-031", "video_id": "Hl-nV1aF1yE", "upload_date": "2026-01-26", "start": "00:03:10", "end": "00:05:10", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Hl-nV1aF1yE&t=190s"}, {"claim_id": "P4-032", "video_id": "Hl-nV1aF1yE", "upload_date": "2026-01-26", "start": "00:05:45", "end": "00:06:45", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Hl-nV1aF1yE&t=345s"}, {"claim_id": "P4-039", "video_id": "KLwLiiYYewQ", "upload_date": "2026-07-08", "start": "00:00:00", "end": "00:00:51", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KLwLiiYYewQ&t=0s"}, {"claim_id": "P4-200", "video_id": "Hl-nV1aF1yE", "upload_date": "2026-01-26", "start": "00:07:04", "end": "00:12:09", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Hl-nV1aF1yE&t=424s"}], "visual_sources": [{"window_id": "V6-05", "video_id": "LpxT2dykNK0", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LpxT2dykNK0&t=30s", "review_status": "reviewed_sampled"}, {"window_id": "V6-06", "video_id": "Hl-nV1aF1yE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Hl-nV1aF1yE&t=180s", "review_status": "reviewed_sampled"}, {"window_id": "V6-07", "video_id": "Hl-nV1aF1yE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Hl-nV1aF1yE&t=335s", "review_status": "reviewed_targeted"}]}
{"id": "P8-03", "question": "Does the ultimate-economy thesis rule out multi-ultimate fight plans?", "classification": "qualified_thesis_and_example_correction", "confidence": "high_for_spoken_scope_limited_visual", "finding": "The title overstates the spoken thesis: economy still matters, especially in named compositions. Spending two or three to secure a consequential retake is consistent with that view. The April follow-up concedes one triple spend was waste while distinguishing another failure of position and conversion after spending.", "open_test": "The claimed OW1-to-OW2 change in relative explanatory weight is unmeasured here; V6-08 omits the prior full spend and V6-11 does not yield reliable exact HUD counts.", "source_claims": [{"claim_id": "P4-053", "video_id": "QvMsOy1wFr4", "upload_date": "2024-12-08", "start": "00:09:35", "end": "00:10:05", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QvMsOy1wFr4&t=575s"}, {"claim_id": "P4-117", "video_id": "QvMsOy1wFr4", "upload_date": "2024-12-08", "start": "00:00:01", "end": "00:03:31", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QvMsOy1wFr4&t=1s"}, {"claim_id": "P4-147", "video_id": "t1dnez3yuZ4", "upload_date": "2025-12-14", "start": "00:02:10", "end": "00:05:57", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=t1dnez3yuZ4&t=130s"}, {"claim_id": "P4-158", "video_id": "1OvQ5PAK0w0", "upload_date": "2025-11-03", "start": "00:14:33", "end": "00:17:32", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1OvQ5PAK0w0&t=873s"}, {"claim_id": "P4-026", "video_id": "aHwWbiUE4KQ", "upload_date": "2026-01-08", "start": "00:00:00", "end": "00:01:35", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aHwWbiUE4KQ&t=0s"}, {"claim_id": "P4-027", "video_id": "aHwWbiUE4KQ", "upload_date": "2026-01-08", "start": "00:01:40", "end": "00:04:10", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aHwWbiUE4KQ&t=100s"}, {"claim_id": "P4-029", "video_id": "aHwWbiUE4KQ", "upload_date": "2026-01-08", "start": "00:07:20", "end": "00:09:15", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aHwWbiUE4KQ&t=440s"}, {"claim_id": "P4-036", "video_id": "GKkzCd9cvUg", "upload_date": "2026-04-09", "start": "00:01:50", "end": "00:03:00", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GKkzCd9cvUg&t=110s"}, {"claim_id": "P4-038", "video_id": "GKkzCd9cvUg", "upload_date": "2026-04-09", "start": "00:06:30", "end": "00:07:55", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GKkzCd9cvUg&t=390s"}, {"claim_id": "P4-198", "video_id": "GKkzCd9cvUg", "upload_date": "2026-04-09", "start": "00:12:02", "end": "00:14:33", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GKkzCd9cvUg&t=722s"}], "visual_sources": [{"window_id": "V6-08", "video_id": "aHwWbiUE4KQ", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aHwWbiUE4KQ&t=90s", "review_status": "reviewed_targeted"}, {"window_id": "V6-09", "video_id": "aHwWbiUE4KQ", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aHwWbiUE4KQ&t=255s", "review_status": "reviewed_sampled"}, {"window_id": "V6-10", "video_id": "QvMsOy1wFr4", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QvMsOy1wFr4&t=560s", "review_status": "reviewed_sampled"}, {"window_id": "V6-11", "video_id": "GKkzCd9cvUg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GKkzCd9cvUg&t=712s", "review_status": "reviewed_sampled"}]}
{"id": "P8-04", "question": "Does proactive setup denial contradict defensive survival or ultimate conservation?", "classification": "phase_and_matchup_distinction", "confidence": "moderate_for_spoken_relationship_limited_visual", "finding": "The claim that a completed good dive is hard to survive motivates acting before setup is complete. A wide clear or early defensive ultimate is one option, while conserving or layering ultimates remains sensible when the team can preserve a useful answer to later threats.", "open_test": "The earlier-Rally choice is counterfactual, and a single edited POV cannot establish the whole team's information or a universal optimal response.", "source_claims": [{"claim_id": "P4-016", "video_id": "MYW1ztAeDQc", "upload_date": "2025-04-30", "start": "00:00:55", "end": "00:01:55", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MYW1ztAeDQc&t=55s"}, {"claim_id": "P4-017", "video_id": "MYW1ztAeDQc", "upload_date": "2025-04-30", "start": "00:04:05", "end": "00:05:42", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MYW1ztAeDQc&t=245s"}, {"claim_id": "P4-018", "video_id": "MYW1ztAeDQc", "upload_date": "2025-04-30", "start": "00:10:00", "end": "00:11:40", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MYW1ztAeDQc&t=600s"}, {"claim_id": "P4-134", "video_id": "MYW1ztAeDQc", "upload_date": "2025-04-30", "start": "00:12:41", "end": "00:15:29", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MYW1ztAeDQc&t=761s"}, {"claim_id": "P4-171", "video_id": "GIY_4hD9_M8", "upload_date": "2025-06-04", "start": "00:03:12", "end": "00:06:09", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GIY_4hD9_M8&t=192s"}, {"claim_id": "P4-175", "video_id": "GIY_4hD9_M8", "upload_date": "2025-06-04", "start": "00:20:20", "end": "00:24:40", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GIY_4hD9_M8&t=1220s"}, {"claim_id": "P4-147", "video_id": "t1dnez3yuZ4", "upload_date": "2025-12-14", "start": "00:02:10", "end": "00:05:57", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=t1dnez3yuZ4&t=130s"}], "visual_sources": [{"window_id": "V6-12", "video_id": "MYW1ztAeDQc", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MYW1ztAeDQc&t=235s", "review_status": "reviewed_sampled"}, {"window_id": "V6-13", "video_id": "MYW1ztAeDQc", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MYW1ztAeDQc&t=590s", "review_status": "reviewed_sampled"}, {"window_id": "V6-14", "video_id": "MYW1ztAeDQc", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MYW1ztAeDQc&t=751s", "review_status": "reviewed_targeted"}, {"window_id": "V6-15", "video_id": "GIY_4hD9_M8", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GIY_4hD9_M8&t=1210s", "review_status": "reviewed_sampled"}]}
{"id": "P8-05", "question": "Can playing second or baiting coexist with attacking first when surrounded?", "classification": "conditional_failure_boundary", "confidence": "moderate_for_spoken_relationship_limited_visual", "finding": "A credible offer must preserve counterpressure and enough resources for a second move. The opponent can accept it, clear the offered player, or use another route. A later guest discussion raises initiating before a pinch completes as a plausible limit, but it is not decisive evidence of Capitology's own rule.", "open_test": "V6-17 overlaps V6-04 and is not another match; the September guest transcript is garbled, so P4-189/190 need audio before attributing each statement.", "source_claims": [{"claim_id": "P4-015", "video_id": "K6Ayz-NHVe4", "upload_date": "2024-11-23", "start": "00:06:40", "end": "00:07:40", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=K6Ayz-NHVe4&t=400s"}, {"claim_id": "P4-054", "video_id": "QvMsOy1wFr4", "upload_date": "2024-12-08", "start": "00:12:10", "end": "00:13:15", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QvMsOy1wFr4&t=730s"}, {"claim_id": "P4-034", "video_id": "KlcWDgdXrZk", "upload_date": "2026-03-08", "start": "00:02:15", "end": "00:06:05", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KlcWDgdXrZk&t=135s"}, {"claim_id": "P4-035", "video_id": "KlcWDgdXrZk", "upload_date": "2026-03-08", "start": "00:10:35", "end": "00:12:15", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KlcWDgdXrZk&t=635s"}, {"claim_id": "P4-199", "video_id": "KlcWDgdXrZk", "upload_date": "2026-03-08", "start": "00:06:10", "end": "00:09:19", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KlcWDgdXrZk&t=370s"}, {"claim_id": "P4-206", "video_id": "KlcWDgdXrZk", "upload_date": "2026-03-08", "start": "00:09:15", "end": "00:11:05", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KlcWDgdXrZk&t=555s"}, {"claim_id": "P4-189", "video_id": "N5fHwbNE-SQ", "upload_date": "2026-09-05", "start": "00:07:10", "end": "00:11:16", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=N5fHwbNE-SQ&t=430s"}, {"claim_id": "P4-190", "video_id": "N5fHwbNE-SQ", "upload_date": "2026-09-05", "start": "00:11:18", "end": "00:15:10", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=N5fHwbNE-SQ&t=678s"}], "visual_sources": [{"window_id": "V6-03", "video_id": "KlcWDgdXrZk", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KlcWDgdXrZk&t=125s", "review_status": "reviewed_sampled"}, {"window_id": "V6-04", "video_id": "KlcWDgdXrZk", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KlcWDgdXrZk&t=545s", "review_status": "reviewed_sampled"}, {"window_id": "V6-16", "video_id": "K6Ayz-NHVe4", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=K6Ayz-NHVe4&t=390s", "review_status": "reviewed_sampled"}, {"window_id": "V6-17", "video_id": "KlcWDgdXrZk", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KlcWDgdXrZk&t=625s", "review_status": "reviewed_sampled"}, {"window_id": "V6-18", "video_id": "KlcWDgdXrZk", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KlcWDgdXrZk&t=360s", "review_status": "reviewed_targeted"}, {"window_id": "V6-19", "video_id": "K6Ayz-NHVe4", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=K6Ayz-NHVe4&t=763s", "review_status": "reviewed_sampled"}]}
{"id": "P8-06", "question": "Does a grouped start contradict the earlier rule to retake with split cores?", "classification": "matchup_specific_adaptation_with_common_mechanism", "confidence": "moderate_for_spoken_relationship_limited_visual", "finding": "The 2023 lesson requires timely counterpressure from separated cores. The 2026 example delays the initial split specifically against a fast teleport/D.Va clear, then separates after the clear commits. Repeated attention exchange extends the earlier push/pull account; identical tactics across eras or compositions are not established.", "open_test": "Two windows are mostly static diagrams; V6-21 and V6-23 do not show complete outcomes or all five starting positions.", "source_claims": [{"claim_id": "P4-001", "video_id": "JM50b3IU6-c", "upload_date": "2023-10-27", "start": "00:00:47", "end": "00:01:17", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JM50b3IU6-c&t=47s"}, {"claim_id": "P4-003", "video_id": "JM50b3IU6-c", "upload_date": "2023-10-27", "start": "00:09:00", "end": "00:10:04", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JM50b3IU6-c&t=540s"}, {"claim_id": "P4-004", "video_id": "JM50b3IU6-c", "upload_date": "2023-10-27", "start": "00:18:40", "end": "00:19:50", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JM50b3IU6-c&t=1120s"}, {"claim_id": "P4-104", "video_id": "JM50b3IU6-c", "upload_date": "2023-10-27", "start": "00:10:10", "end": "00:13:10", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JM50b3IU6-c&t=610s"}, {"claim_id": "P4-105", "video_id": "JM50b3IU6-c", "upload_date": "2023-10-27", "start": "00:13:20", "end": "00:15:15", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JM50b3IU6-c&t=800s"}, {"claim_id": "P4-143", "video_id": "M8393UkZxjY", "upload_date": "2025-12-19", "start": "00:05:57", "end": "00:09:59", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=M8393UkZxjY&t=357s"}, {"claim_id": "P4-144", "video_id": "M8393UkZxjY", "upload_date": "2025-12-19", "start": "00:09:59", "end": "00:13:10", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=M8393UkZxjY&t=599s"}, {"claim_id": "P4-091", "video_id": "ijlmDdVIdtk", "upload_date": "2026-04-27", "start": "00:01:10", "end": "00:02:35", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ijlmDdVIdtk&t=70s"}, {"claim_id": "P4-193", "video_id": "ijlmDdVIdtk", "upload_date": "2026-04-27", "start": "00:02:41", "end": "00:05:46", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ijlmDdVIdtk&t=161s"}], "visual_sources": [{"window_id": "V6-20", "video_id": "JM50b3IU6-c", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JM50b3IU6-c&t=530s", "review_status": "reviewed_sampled"}, {"window_id": "V6-21", "video_id": "JM50b3IU6-c", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JM50b3IU6-c&t=1110s", "review_status": "reviewed_targeted"}, {"window_id": "V6-22", "video_id": "ijlmDdVIdtk", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ijlmDdVIdtk&t=60s", "review_status": "reviewed_sampled"}, {"window_id": "V6-23", "video_id": "ijlmDdVIdtk", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ijlmDdVIdtk&t=151s", "review_status": "reviewed_targeted"}]}
{"id": "P8-07", "question": "Does forward scouting conflict with hiding the final setup?", "classification": "sequential_phases", "confidence": "moderate_for_spoken_relationship_only", "finding": "A team may show briefly to learn the walk-up, then withdraw and hide the final position. Broad sight and concealment occur at different moments; the claims do not instruct simultaneous exposure and hiding.", "open_test": "No selected visual window independently verifies information held by both teams in these examples.", "source_claims": [{"claim_id": "P4-183", "video_id": "cXnFhS2l47g", "upload_date": "2025-03-28", "start": "00:03:20", "end": "00:05:57", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cXnFhS2l47g&t=200s"}, {"claim_id": "P4-019", "video_id": "E1bYy6OE_OQ", "upload_date": "2025-07-02", "start": "00:00:45", "end": "00:01:39", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=E1bYy6OE_OQ&t=45s"}, {"claim_id": "P4-020", "video_id": "E1bYy6OE_OQ", "upload_date": "2025-07-02", "start": "00:02:00", "end": "00:03:20", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=E1bYy6OE_OQ&t=120s"}, {"claim_id": "P4-132", "video_id": "E1bYy6OE_OQ", "upload_date": "2025-07-02", "start": "00:05:21", "end": "00:08:25", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=E1bYy6OE_OQ&t=321s"}], "visual_sources": []}
{"id": "P8-08", "question": "Must a damage player take an early angle or delay the obvious flank?", "classification": "visibility_and_timing_condition", "confidence": "moderate_for_spoken_relationship_only", "finding": "The early-angle advice concerns being useful before an intended early fight. Delaying an obvious flank or shot can preserve surprise when the position would otherwise be pre-cleared or its sight line adds nothing. There is no fixed flank quota in the later account.", "open_test": "The ledger has no paired visual test of these DPS choices; P4-192 includes guest speech and needs careful attribution.", "source_claims": [{"claim_id": "P4-073", "video_id": "aNBstKtsPms", "upload_date": "2025-09-04", "start": "00:02:40", "end": "00:03:50", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aNBstKtsPms&t=160s"}, {"claim_id": "P4-074", "video_id": "aNBstKtsPms", "upload_date": "2025-09-04", "start": "00:04:55", "end": "00:06:30", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aNBstKtsPms&t=295s"}, {"claim_id": "P4-083", "video_id": "M8393UkZxjY", "upload_date": "2025-12-19", "start": "00:14:00", "end": "00:16:25", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=M8393UkZxjY&t=840s"}, {"claim_id": "P4-084", "video_id": "jSCHyAWoUjc", "upload_date": "2025-12-21", "start": "00:04:45", "end": "00:06:05", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jSCHyAWoUjc&t=285s"}, {"claim_id": "P4-089", "video_id": "mXrTyliwJTI", "upload_date": "2026-04-16", "start": "00:00:00", "end": "00:01:00", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mXrTyliwJTI&t=0s"}, {"claim_id": "P4-192", "video_id": "prUv2eNrGD0", "upload_date": "2026-06-08", "start": "00:20:18", "end": "00:22:55", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=prUv2eNrGD0&t=1218s"}], "visual_sources": []}
{"id": "P8-09", "question": "Do proactive defensive ultimates conflict with holding them for later threats?", "classification": "resource_sequence_condition", "confidence": "moderate_for_spoken_relationship_limited_visual", "finding": "Spending early to prevent a nearly finished setup and saving an ultimate after a successful kite answer different threat sequences. The shared question is whether the resource preserves a usable fight and next response, not whether earlier or later is intrinsically best.", "open_test": "The optimal counterfactual spend and exact ability order are not established by the sampled, single-POV footage.", "source_claims": [{"claim_id": "P4-134", "video_id": "MYW1ztAeDQc", "upload_date": "2025-04-30", "start": "00:12:41", "end": "00:15:29", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MYW1ztAeDQc&t=761s"}, {"claim_id": "P4-158", "video_id": "1OvQ5PAK0w0", "upload_date": "2025-11-03", "start": "00:14:33", "end": "00:17:32", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1OvQ5PAK0w0&t=873s"}, {"claim_id": "P4-171", "video_id": "GIY_4hD9_M8", "upload_date": "2025-06-04", "start": "00:03:12", "end": "00:06:09", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GIY_4hD9_M8&t=192s"}, {"claim_id": "P4-175", "video_id": "GIY_4hD9_M8", "upload_date": "2025-06-04", "start": "00:20:20", "end": "00:24:40", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GIY_4hD9_M8&t=1220s"}, {"claim_id": "P4-147", "video_id": "t1dnez3yuZ4", "upload_date": "2025-12-14", "start": "00:02:10", "end": "00:05:57", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=t1dnez3yuZ4&t=130s"}, {"claim_id": "P4-176", "video_id": "GIY_4hD9_M8", "upload_date": "2025-06-04", "start": "00:28:19", "end": "00:31:10", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GIY_4hD9_M8&t=1699s"}], "visual_sources": [{"window_id": "V6-14", "video_id": "MYW1ztAeDQc", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MYW1ztAeDQc&t=751s", "review_status": "reviewed_targeted"}, {"window_id": "V6-15", "video_id": "GIY_4hD9_M8", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GIY_4hD9_M8&t=1210s", "review_status": "reviewed_sampled"}]}
{"id": "P8-10", "question": "Did ultimate economy become generally less decisive from OW1 to OW2?", "classification": "unresolved_empirical_comparison", "confidence": "high_for_speaker_attribution_low_for_empirical_test", "finding": "The speaker explicitly proposes an era-level difference, with composition exceptions. The selected clips illustrate possible mechanisms but do not estimate the relative contribution of ultimate inventory to wins across eras.", "open_test": "A controlled, patch-aware set of comparable fights or a clearly defined quantitative measure is needed; the juxtaposed OW1/OW2 footage changes teams and metas.", "source_claims": [{"claim_id": "P4-026", "video_id": "aHwWbiUE4KQ", "upload_date": "2026-01-08", "start": "00:00:00", "end": "00:01:35", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aHwWbiUE4KQ&t=0s"}, {"claim_id": "P4-027", "video_id": "aHwWbiUE4KQ", "upload_date": "2026-01-08", "start": "00:01:40", "end": "00:04:10", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aHwWbiUE4KQ&t=100s"}, {"claim_id": "P4-028", "video_id": "aHwWbiUE4KQ", "upload_date": "2026-01-08", "start": "00:04:25", "end": "00:06:40", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aHwWbiUE4KQ&t=265s"}, {"claim_id": "P4-029", "video_id": "aHwWbiUE4KQ", "upload_date": "2026-01-08", "start": "00:07:20", "end": "00:09:15", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aHwWbiUE4KQ&t=440s"}, {"claim_id": "P4-036", "video_id": "GKkzCd9cvUg", "upload_date": "2026-04-09", "start": "00:01:50", "end": "00:03:00", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GKkzCd9cvUg&t=110s"}], "visual_sources": [{"window_id": "V6-08", "video_id": "aHwWbiUE4KQ", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aHwWbiUE4KQ&t=90s", "review_status": "reviewed_targeted"}, {"window_id": "V6-09", "video_id": "aHwWbiUE4KQ", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aHwWbiUE4KQ&t=255s", "review_status": "reviewed_sampled"}]}
